
# Workforce Manager

A DBMS mini project made to manage workers, departments, tasks, attendance and complaints in one place.

## Features

- Separate login for Admin, Supervisor and Worker
- Manage worker and department details
- Assign tasks and track their status
- Maintain attendance records
- Register and manage complaints
- View worker performance
- Store and fetch data using Supabase

## Technologies Used

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- Supabase (PostgreSQL)

## How to Run

1. Download or clone this repository.
2. Open the project folder.
3. Configure your Supabase project URL and API key in `app.js`.
4. Make sure the required database tables and permissions are set up in Supabase.
5. Open `index.html` in your browser.

## Project Structure

- `index.html` - Main pages and layout
- `style.css` - Styling and responsive layout
- `app.js` - Login, dashboard and database operations

